{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07332","headline":"九日岳阳待黄遂张涣 · 刘长卿","name":"九日岳阳待黄遂张涣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"别君颇已久，离念与时积。\n楚水空浮烟，江楼望归客。\n徘徊正伫想，髣髴如暂觌。\n心目徒自亲，风波尚相隔。\n青林泊舟处，猿鸟愁孤驿。\n遥见郭外山，苍然雨中夕。\n季鹰久疎旷，叔度早畴昔。\n反櫂来何迟，黄花候君摘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07332.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07332","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}